    LLM: 'Bid with strong hands, especially with good trump support. Declare all melds. Try to capture the trump Jack and 9.\n\nConsider the Mesa risk when bidding - a failed contract is devastating. Coordinate with partner through card play. Save high trumps for important tricks.\n\nCard counting is essential. Track trumps and high cards. Understand when to sacrifice a trick to set up future wins. Master the compulsory overtaking rules.',
